**Payer agreement term.** The intravenous solution (code J7050 under revenue code 0258) on an Outpatient Surgery Account of the Hospital Account (Encounter Billing), valued for an Insurance Claim (Third-Party Billing), carries a rate per counted unit of:
- 2.10 USD on a Commercial PPO Claim;
- 2.60 USD on a Commercial HMO Claim;
- otherwise (a Marketplace Exchange Plan Claim), its charges per counted unit times the payer class's expected allowed percentage.

It is valued at its counted units times that rate, never above its charges, its counted units being its billed units, or one when it is billed with charges but no units.

Input, judgement, output (hypothetical): 5 units, Commercial PPO Claim, charges 40.00 → 5 times 2.10 → 10.50; charges 8.00 → capped → 8.00.
